bility; if this is wrong, and long-term code maintainability is the sole driver of firm value, I would shift toward aggressive, automated refactoring tools. Second, I assume that human developers remain the primary bottleneck; if AI-driven autonomy fully replaces human oversight, my focus would shift from 'onboarding speed' to 'output-based performance bounds.' 🚀",
