ion strategy: use symbolic verifiers for routine task-based operations, but mandate formal method verification for all models interacting with high-stakes domains like healthcare or finance. This strategy provides a clear audit trail for regulators, reducing the risk of catastrophic failure while maintaining the velocity required to remain competitive in an environment where 88% of businesses are already integrating AI into core functions.",
